2336	    
2337	    Args:
2338	        repo_path: Repository path (absolute)
2339	        working_directory: Working directory (absolute path)
2340	        api_name: Name of the API/function/class to find examples for
2341	        max_examples: Maximum number of examples to return
2342	        group_by_pattern: Whether to group similar usage patterns together
2343	        include_test_examples: Whether to include examples from test files
2344	        show_context_lines: Number of context lines around each usage
2345	    
2346	    Returns:
